     "content": {
      "size": -1,
      "mimeType": "application/json",
      "text": "{\"project_id\":\"project-70e55fda6b704c9ea5cafe2727ae9bbf\",\"shot_id\":\"shot-d9bd124849764ea1bd2b96331cc97615\",\"project_version\":90,\"versions\":[{\"id\":\"299c242c-bc91-4c09-9d4e-471a538384c7\",\"entity_id\":\"result-299c242c-bc91-4c09-9d4e-471a538384c7\",\"job_id\":\"ce41c73a-c644-4f3a-9d63-145e770eff41\",\"source_shot_id\":\"shot-d9bd124849764ea1bd2b96331cc97615\",\"aliased\":false,\"trash_state\":\"active\",\"trash_version\":90,\"recipe_status\":\"known\",\"recipe\":{\"controls\":{\"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\",\"duration\":6,\"generate_audio\":true,\"resolution\":\"480P\",\"seed\":\"164146785\"},\"inputs\":{\"audios\":[{\"asset_id\":\"5a1fe157ca8a4ac5ac39500831615d29\",\"source_range\":{\"end\":6,\"start\":0}}],\"first_frame\":null,\"guides\":[],\"images\":[{\"asset_id\":\"7eef7db3892544de9144df13287c7fab\"},{\"asset_id\":\"777402a9750b42d590617a0626cf48e7\"},{\"asset_id\":\"614e86e33bc64c72976ec46b7cb7a2bb\"}],\"last_frame\":null,\"videos\":[]},\"prompt\":\"草地与石砌牛圈（海岛沿岸开阔的金黄色荒草地，带有一座由粗糙乱石堆砌而成的简陋矮牛圈，木栅门破损敞开，泥土上混杂着牛蹄印与大脚印。）\\n儿子（三兄弟）（奇幻古朴外观。三兄弟是三个独立的年轻男子，总是肩并肩站在一起、一起走，各有自己的身体、手和腿。左边老大最壮、满脸黑胡、穿棕色粗麻短袍；中间老二清瘦干净、穿灰白短袍、脖子围旧蓝围巾；右边老三圆脸、穿土黄短袍、手拿圆面包。）\\n圆面包（古代粗麦烤制的干硬圆形粗粮面包。）\\n黄昏斜阳逆光，广角低机位跟拍，三兄弟肩并肩赶着一群红牛在草地上前行，左边老大粗暴瞪牛喊道(S1) <d>[Chinese] 今天吃牛。</d>，中间老二弱声护道(S2) <d>[Chinese] 那是阿花。</d>，右边老三咀嚼着面包慢吞吞嘟囔(S3) <d>[Chinese] 有面包。</d>。\",\"recipe_id\":\"video-ref-v1\",\"tier\":null,\"mode\":\"ref\"},\"authoring_context\":{\"global_defaults\":{},\"links\":[],\"profiles\":[{\"data\":{\"defaultLookId\":\"main\",\"looks\":[{\"description\":\"\",\"gallery\":{},\"id\":\"main\",\"imageIds\":[\"image-pic-ec0eef6d51c9-a-610a7db6e16d38\"],\"name\":\"默认造型\",\"version\":2}],\"mainVoiceId\":\"\",\"voices\":[]},\"description\":\"奇幻古朴外观。三兄弟是三个独立的年轻男子，总是肩并肩站在一起、一起走，各有自己的身体、手和腿。左边老大最壮、满脸黑胡、穿棕色粗麻短袍；中间老二清瘦干净、穿灰白短袍、脖子围旧蓝围巾；右边老三圆脸、穿土黄短袍、手拿圆面包。\",\"id\":\"character-a95acd88a7b043c6b3610a7db6e16d38\",\"order\":1,\"parentId\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"儿子（三兄弟）\",\"type\":\"character\",\"version\":3},{\"data\":{\"ambient\":null,\"defaultVersionId\":\"main\",\"versions\":[{\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"main\",\"imageIds\":[\"image-pic-ec0eef6d51c9-a-4a9e676a8e539a\"],\"name\":\"默认\",\"version\":2}]},\"description\":\"海岛沿岸开阔的金黄色荒草地，带有一座由粗糙乱石堆砌而成的简陋矮牛圈，木栅门破损敞开，泥土上混杂着牛蹄印与大脚印。\",\"id\":\"location-e283f27ad19146f6ba4a9e676a8e539a\",\"order\":4,\"parentId\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"草地与石砌牛圈\",\"type\":\"location\",\"version\":2},{\"data\":{\"imageIds\":[\"image-pic-ec0eef6d51c9-a-0d058e29e89460\"]},\"description\":\"古代粗麦烤制的干硬圆形粗粮面包。\",\"id\":\"prop-6bfa25ffe91b49ae9a0d058e29e89460\",\"order\":7,\"parentId\":null,\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"圆面包\",\"type\":\"prop\",\"version\":2}],\"scene\":{\"data\":{\"script\":\"\"},\"description\":\"\",\"id\":\"scene-57ec766d14545d9b9eab490902f7297f\",\"order\":0,\"parentId\":\"chapter-f344db71b5895957bd5a446d18a93568\",\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"场景 1\",\"type\":\"scene\",\"version\":2},\"shot\":{\"data\":{\"cast\":[{\"characterId\":\"character-a95acd88a7b043c6b3610a7db6e16d38\",\"lookId\":\"\"}],\"prompt\":\"黄昏斜阳逆光，广角低机位跟拍，三兄弟肩并肩赶着一群红牛在草地上前行，左边老大粗暴瞪牛喊道(S1) <d>[Chinese] 今天吃牛。</d>，中间老二弱声护道(S2) <d>[Chinese] 那是阿花。</d>，右边老三咀嚼着面包慢吞吞嘟囔(S3) <d>[Chinese] 有面包。</d>。\",\"seconds\":6,\"storyboard\":{\"dialogueTrack\":{\"entityId\":\"dialogue-track-s01\"},\"mode\":\"ref\",\"place\":{\"locationId\":\"location-e283f27ad19146f6ba4a9e676a8e539a\"},\"propIds\":[\"prop-6bfa25ffe91b49ae9a0d058e29e89460\"],\"quality\":\"draft\",\"version\":1}},\"description\":\"黄昏斜阳逆光，广角低机位跟拍，三兄弟肩并肩赶着一群红牛在草地上前行，左边老大粗暴瞪牛喊道(S1) <d>[Chinese] 今天吃牛。</d>，中间老二弱声护道(S2) <d>[Chinese] 那是阿花。</d>，右边老三咀嚼着面包慢吞吞嘟囔(S3) <d>[Chinese] 有面包。</d>。\",\"id\":\"shot-d9bd124849764ea1bd2b96331cc97615\",\"order\":0,\"parentId\":\"scene-57ec766d14545d9b9eab490902f7297f\",\"status\":\"draft\",\"title\":\"\",\"type\":\"shot\",\"version\":3},\"storyboard\":{}},\"starred\":false,\"title\":\"Generated result\",\"annotation_version\":90,\"selected\":true,\"created